OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHow AI visionary Jensen Huang was
OL,4,Aundone by his own bad decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf I'd told you this time last week
OL,7,Fthat Jensen Huang was about to leave
OL,8,FNvidia, you would not have believed me.
OL,10,FThe man who co-founded this enormously
OL,11,Fsuccessful AI chip company, working
OL,12,Ftirelessly to build it from the ground
OL,13,Fup and steering it through some
OL,14,Fdisastrous times with endless energy
OL,15,Fand ruthless determination, has
OL,16,Fultimately been undone by his own love
OL,17,Flife.
OL,19,FIt's an extraordinary tale and a
OL,20,Fstrangely old fashioned one for a tech
OL,21,Ffirm with its sights set on the future.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
