OL,3,AWhat we know as Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang
OL,4,Aresigns over affair allegations
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuang admitted earlier this week to
OL,7,Fhaving been "unfaithful" to his wife
OL,8,Fand he apologised for hurting her and
OL,9,Ftheir children.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/19
